    "Lets vim or tmux on a device copy into the Mac's clipboard. Off by default: a compromised device could plant a command for your next ⌘V. When on, pasting text a session set always asks first. Reading the clipboard is never allowed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lets vim or tmux on a device copy into the Mac's clipboard. Off by default: a compromised device could plant a command for your next ⌘V. When on, pasting text a session set always asks first. Reading the clipboard is never allowed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
